---
// RAMpage as built, from the team's final presentation, the README and the firmware: the FlySky
// receiver drives the 4-in-1 ESC directly on CH2 and CH3 (left and right drive) with no software in the path; the Pico W
// separately reads CH5 (kill, GP18) and CH6 (trigger, GP19) with pin interrupts, drives the
// exhaust (GP14) and the inlets (GP15), and switches the receiver's power through a solid-state
// relay; the Pi 4B streams JPEG frames over UDP port 5000 to video_direct.py on the driver's
// laptop. There is no link between the Pico W and the Pi.
import Drawing from './Drawing.astro';
---

<Drawing
  title="RAMpage: two independent controllers"
  label="RAMpage's system: the RC receiver drives the ESC directly and feeds the Pico W, which fires the valves and can cut the receiver's power through a solid-state relay, while a Pi 4B streams camera video over UDP to the driver's laptop."
  viewBox="0 0 640 330"
  legend={[
    'The Pico W reads the kill switch (CH5, GP18) and the trigger (CH6, GP19) with hardware pin interrupts. Trigger to solenoid: 31.5 ms on average.',
    'It runs the valve sequence: exhaust (GP14) open 50 ms, closed, a 50 ms dwell, both inlets (GP15) open 400 ms, exhaust open again to vent.',
    'Video goes its own way: the Pi 4B sends JPEG frames over UDP to the driver laptop, so a video crash never touches the weapon.',
    'A kill, a lost signal or an error opens the exhaust and cuts the receiver\'s power through the solid-state relay, which puts the ESC into failsafe, within 35 ms.',
  ]}
  note="No wire joins the Pico W and the Pi: the two systems are independent."
>
  <rect class="s f" pathLength="1" x="16" y="30" width="150" height="56"></rect>
  <text class="t" x="28" y="54">RC receiver</text>
  <text class="t t--muted" x="28" y="72">FlySky FS-iA6B</text>

  <rect class="s f" pathLength="1" x="246" y="18" width="150" height="56"></rect>
  <text class="t" x="258" y="42">Pico W</text>
  <text class="t t--muted" x="258" y="60">weapon and safety</text>

  <rect class="s f" pathLength="1" x="474" y="18" width="150" height="70"></rect>
  <text class="t" x="486" y="42">Valves</text>
  <text class="t t--muted" x="486" y="60">exhaust GP14,</text>
  <text class="t t--muted" x="486" y="76">inlets GP15</text>

  <rect class="s f" pathLength="1" x="246" y="110" width="150" height="50"></rect>
  <text class="t" x="258" y="132">4-in-1 ESC</text>
  <text class="t t--muted" x="258" y="149">BLHeli_32, 70 A, direct</text>

  <rect class="s f" pathLength="1" x="474" y="110" width="150" height="50"></rect>
